{"_id":"preset_1","preset":1,"lines":[{"text":"天体运行，周而复始。","duration":9000},{"text":"星汉灿烂，若出其里。","duration":9000},{"text":"日月之行，若出其中。","duration":9000},{"text":"俯察品类之盛，仰观宇宙之大。","duration":9000},{"text":"寄蜉蝣于天地，渺沧海之一粟。","duration":9000},{"text":"此中有真意，欲辨已忘言。","duration":9000},{"text":"天地与我并生，万物与我为一。","duration":9000},{"text":"天行有常，不为尧存，不为桀亡。","duration":9000},{"text":"寒来暑往，秋收冬藏。","duration":9000},{"text":"仰观天文，俯察地理。","duration":9000},{"text":"星垂平野，月涌大江。","duration":9000},{"text":"河汉清且浅，相去复几许。","duration":9000},{"text":"日月光华，旦复旦兮。","duration":9000},{"text":"风行水上，草木含辉。","duration":9000},{"text":"物换星移，时序递嬗。","duration":9000},{"text":"沧海月明，珠有泪。","duration":9000},{"text":"乾坤朗朗，四序循环。","duration":9000},{"text":"晨昏代谢，宇宙不息。","duration":9000},{"text":"斗转星移，夜长天阔。","duration":9000},{"text":"人在天地间，若白驹过隙。","duration":9000}],"updatedAt":1731218402000}
{"_id":"preset_1E","preset":101.0,"lines":[{"text":"Heavenly spheres turn, in endless return","duration":9000},{"text":"The river of stars gleams, as if from within","duration":9000},{"text":"Sun and moon in their courses, as if from within","duration":9000},{"text":"Beneath life’s multitudes, above the boundless cosmos","duration":9000},{"text":"A mayfly to heaven and earth, a mote in the sea","duration":9000},{"text":"True meaning abides, words fall away","duration":9000},{"text":"Heaven and earth arise with me, all things are one","duration":9000},{"text":"Heaven keeps its course, not by sages kept nor by tyrants undone","duration":9000},{"text":"Cold comes then heat goes, autumn gathers winter stores","duration":9000},{"text":"We read the sky above, we read the earth below","duration":9000},{"text":"Stars hang over the plain, the moon swells the river","duration":9000},{"text":"The Milky Way seems near, how far are we apart","duration":9000},{"text":"Sunlight and moonshine, day after day","duration":9000},{"text":"Wind walks the water, grasses and trees glow","duration":9000},{"text":"Things alter and stars shift, the seasons turn on","duration":9000},{"text":"Over the vast sea the moon shines, pearls keep hidden tears","duration":9000},{"text":"Heaven and earth stand clear, the four seasons wheel","duration":9000},{"text":"Dawn yields to dusk, the cosmos breathes on","duration":9000},{"text":"The Dipper wheels slowly, the night opens wide","duration":9000},{"text":"We pass through this world, like a white foal through a gap","duration":9000}],"updatedAt":1731218402005}
{"_id":"OUT OF DARKNESS","lines":[{"text":"OUT OF DARKNESS","duration":10000.0,"start-time":6000.0},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":19000.0,"text":"Performed by, Aubrey Ashburn"},{"text":"Listen to my voice","duration":5000.0,"start-time":34000.0},{"duration":3000.0,"start-time":39000.0,"text":"calling you"},{"duration":6000.0,"start-time":42000.0,"text":"Pulling you, out of darkness"},{"duration":6000.0,"start-time":48000.0,"text":"Hear the, Devil's cry of sin"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":54000.0,"text":"Always turn your back, on him"},{"duration":5000.0,"start-time":66000.0,"text":"With the wind you go"},{"duration":9000.0,"start-time":71000.0,"text":"Still I dream of your spirit, leading you back home"},{"start-time":80000.0,"text":"I will give my gifts to you","duration":7000.0},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":87000.0,"text":"Grow your garden, watch it bloom"},{"duration":7000.0,"start-time":105000.0,"text":"The light in your eyes, is an angel up high"},{"duration":8000.0,"start-time":112000.0,"text":"Fighting to ease, the shadow side"},{"duration":6000.0,"start-time":120000.0,"text":"Hearts will grow, though having to bend"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":126000.0,"text":"Leaving behind, all things in the end"},{"start-time":140000.0,"text":"Listen to my voice","duration":5000.0},{"duration":4000.0,"start-time":145000.0,"text":"calling you"},{"duration":5000.0,"start-time":149000.0,"text":"Pulling you, out of darkness"},{"duration":7000.0,"start-time":154000.0,"text":"Hear the, Devil's cry of sin"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":161000.0,"text":"Always turn your back, on him"},{"duration":7000.0,"start-time":172000.0,"text":"On him"},{"duration":5000.0,"start-time":179000.0,"text":"On him"}],"preset":103.0,"updatedAt":1.764689677E+12}
{"_id":"冲破黑暗","lines":[{"duration":12000.0,"start-time":8000.0,"text":"冲破黑暗"},{"start-time":34000.0,"text":"聆听我声音","duration":5000.0},{"duration":3000.0,"start-time":39000.0,"text":"呼唤你"},{"start-time":42000.0,"text":"牵引你，走出幽暗","duration":6000.0},{"duration":6000.0,"start-time":48000.0,"text":"听那，罪恶悲鸣"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":54000.0,"text":"决然转身，背弃他"},{"start-time":66000.0,"text":"随风而去","duration":5000.0},{"text":"梦萦你魂灵，引你归途","duration":9000.0,"start-time":71000.0},{"duration":7000.0,"start-time":80000.0,"text":"愿将天赋，赐予你"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":87000.0,"text":"耕耘心田，静待花开"},{"start-time":105000.0,"text":"眸中微光，似天使守望","duration":7000.0},{"duration":8000.0,"start-time":112000.0,"text":"驱散阴霾，抚平创伤"},{"text":"心虽经曲折，终将茁壮","duration":6000.0,"start-time":120000.0},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":126000.0,"text":"万般过往，终抛身后"},{"start-time":140000.0,"text":"聆听我声音","duration":5000.0},{"duration":4000.0,"start-time":145000.0,"text":"呼唤你"},{"start-time":149000.0,"text":"牵引你，走出幽暗","duration":5000.0},{"duration":7000.0,"start-time":154000.0,"text":"听那，罪恶悲鸣"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":161000.0,"text":"决然转身，背弃他"},{"duration":7000.0,"start-time":172000.0,"text":"背弃他"},{"duration":5000.0,"start-time":179000.0,"text":"背弃他"}],"preset":3.0,"updatedAt":1.764689677E+12}
{"_id":"HOW DEEP IS YOUR LOVE","preset":102.0,"updatedAt":1.764689677E+12,"lines":[{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":3000.0,"text":"HOW DEEP IS YOUR LOVE"},{"duration":5000.0,"start-time":13000.0,"text":"BeeGees"},{"start-time":18000.0,"text":"I know your eyes, in the morning sun","duration":3980.0},{"duration":5020.0,"start-time":21980.0,"text":"I feel you touch me, in the pouring rain"},{"duration":4690.0,"start-time":27000.0,"text":"And the moment that, you wander far from me"},{"duration":4310.0,"start-time":31690.0,"text":"I want to feel you, in my arms again"},{"start-time":36000.0,"text":"And you come to me, on a summer breeze","duration":4890.0},{"duration":4810.0,"start-time":40890.0,"text":"Keep me warm in your love, then you softly leave"},{"duration":3450.0,"start-time":45700.0,"text":"And it's me you need to show"},{"duration":6370.0,"start-time":49150.0,"text":"How deep is your love"},{"duration":3250.0,"start-time":55520.0,"text":"I really mean to learn"},{"duration":4760.0,"start-time":58770.0,"text":"'Cause we're living in, a world of fools"},{"duration":7330.0,"start-time":63530.0,"text":"Breaking us down, when they all should let us be"},{"duration":3830.0,"start-time":70860.0,"text":"We belong to you and me"},{"duration":2640.0,"start-time":74690.0,"text":"I believe in you"},{"duration":4510.0,"start-time":77330.0,"text":"You know the door, to my very soul"},{"duration":5250.0,"start-time":81840.0,"text":"You're the light in my deepest, darkest hour"},{"duration":4390.0,"start-time":87090.0,"text":"You're my savior when I fall"},{"text":"And you may not think, I care for you","duration":4860.0,"start-time":91480.0},{"duration":4389.0,"start-time":96340.0,"text":"When you know down, inside that I really do"},{"duration":3541.0,"start-time":100729.0,"text":"And it's me you need to show"},{"text":"How deep is your love","duration":6320.0,"start-time":104270.0},{"duration":3389.0,"start-time":110590.0,"text":"I really mean to learn"},{"duration":4250.0,"start-time":113979.0,"text":"'Cause we're living in, a world of fools"},{"duration":7251.0,"start-time":118229.0,"text":"Breaking us down, when they all should let us be"},{"text":"We belong to you and me","duration":10000.0,"start-time":125480.0},{"duration":5150.0,"start-time":145900.0,"text":"And you come to me, on a summer breeze"},{"duration":4750.0,"start-time":151050.0,"text":"Keep me warm in your love, then you softly leave"},{"duration":3560.0,"start-time":155800.0,"text":"And it's me you need to show"},{"duration":5650.0,"start-time":159360.0,"text":"How deep is your love"},{"duration":3640.0,"start-time":165010.0,"text":"I really mean to learn"},{"duration":4500.0,"start-time":168650.0,"text":"'Cause we're living in, a world of fools"},{"text":"Breaking us down, when they all should let us be","duration":6390.0,"start-time":173150.0},{"start-time":179540.0,"text":"We belong to you and me","duration":10000.0},{"duration":5150.0,"start-time":189690.0,"text":"How deep is your love"},{"text":"I really mean to learn","duration":3390.0,"start-time":194840.0},{"start-time":198230.0,"text":"'Cause we're living in, a world of fools","duration":4250.0},{"start-time":202480.0,"text":"Breaking us down, when they all should let us be","duration":7000.0},{"start-time":209480.0,"text":"We belong to you and me","duration":9650.0},{"duration":5380.0,"start-time":219130.0,"text":"How deep is your love"},{"duration":3260.0,"start-time":224510.0,"text":"I really mean to learn"},{"duration":4740.0,"start-time":227770.0,"text":"'Cause we're living in, a world of fools"},{"duration":6760.0,"start-time":232510.0,"text":"Breaking us down, when they all should let us be"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":239270.0,"text":"We belong to you and me"}]}
{"_id":"君情深几许","preset":2.0,"updatedAt":1.764689677E+12,"lines":[{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":3000.0,"text":"君情深几许"},{"duration":5000.0,"start-time":13000.0,"text":"Bee Gees"},{"duration":3980.0,"start-time":18000.0,"text":"晨曦微露，读懂你眼眸"},{"text":"大雨滂沱，感你指尖温热","duration":5020.0,"start-time":21980.0},{"duration":4690.0,"start-time":27000.0,"text":"当你游离，远去那一刻"},{"duration":4310.0,"start-time":31690.0,"text":"只想紧拥你，重回我怀中"},{"duration":4890.0,"start-time":36000.0,"text":"随夏日微风，你款款而来"},{"duration":4810.0,"start-time":40890.0,"text":"予我暖爱，又悄然离去"},{"duration":3450.0,"start-time":45700.0,"text":"请向我证明"},{"duration":6370.0,"start-time":49150.0,"text":"君情深几许"},{"duration":3250.0,"start-time":55520.0,"text":"我愿探寻"},{"duration":4760.0,"start-time":58770.0,"text":"身处这愚昧凡尘"},{"start-time":63530.0,"text":"世人阻挠，本应成全","duration":7330.0},{"duration":3830.0,"start-time":70860.0,"text":"你我本属于彼此"},{"duration":2640.0,"start-time":74690.0,"text":"我深信你"},{"duration":4510.0,"start-time":77330.0,"text":"通往灵魂之门，唯你知晓"},{"duration":5250.0,"start-time":81840.0,"text":"至暗时刻，你便是光"},{"duration":4390.0,"start-time":87090.0,"text":"坠落之际，你来救赎"},{"duration":4860.0,"start-time":91480.0,"text":"许你以为，我未曾在意"},{"duration":4389.0,"start-time":96340.0,"text":"然我深情，你心中自知"},{"duration":3541.0,"start-time":100729.0,"text":"请向我证明"},{"duration":6320.0,"start-time":104270.0,"text":"君情深几许"},{"duration":3389.0,"start-time":110590.0,"text":"我愿探寻"},{"duration":4250.0,"start-time":113979.0,"text":"身处这愚昧凡尘"},{"duration":7251.0,"start-time":118229.0,"text":"世人阻挠，本应成全"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":125480.0,"text":"你我本属于彼此"},{"duration":5150.0,"start-time":145900.0,"text":"随夏日微风，你款款而来"},{"start-time":151050.0,"text":"予我暖爱，又悄然离去","duration":4750.0},{"duration":3560.0,"start-time":155800.0,"text":"请向我证明"},{"start-time":159360.0,"text":"君情深几许","duration":5650.0},{"duration":3640.0,"start-time":165010.0,"text":"我愿探寻"},{"duration":4500.0,"start-time":168650.0,"text":"身处这愚昧凡尘"},{"duration":6390.0,"start-time":173150.0,"text":"世人阻挠，本应成全"},{"start-time":179540.0,"text":"你我本属于彼此","duration":10000.0},{"start-time":189690.0,"text":"君情深几许","duration":5150.0},{"start-time":194840.0,"text":"我愿探寻","duration":3390.0},{"text":"身处这愚昧凡尘","duration":4250.0,"start-time":198230.0},{"duration":7000.0,"start-time":202480.0,"text":"世人阻挠，本应成全"},{"duration":9650.0,"start-time":209480.0,"text":"你我本属于彼此"},{"duration":5380.0,"start-time":219130.0,"text":"君情深几许"},{"duration":3260.0,"start-time":224510.0,"text":"我愿探寻"},{"duration":4740.0,"start-time":227770.0,"text":"身处这愚昧凡尘"},{"duration":6760.0,"start-time":232510.0,"text":"世人阻挠，本应成全"},{"duration":10000.0,"start-time":239270.0,"text":"你我本属于彼此"}]}
